---
// /discord (routing-locale "The /discord page", information-architecture section 7.10, D-29, D-41): the community rules
// in both languages on one URL, pt-BR first, each container complete with its own date, checkbox and join links. The
// gate is CSS only (global.css `.gate`): no script, no form, no cookie, no storage, no request. The checkbox is a UX
// confirmation and nothing else; nothing here says or implies that agreement is recorded, verified or enforced.
// WhatsApp appears only inside the pt-BR container. The page is noindex, has no canonical and no hreflang, and is not in
// the sitemap. Every external link is rel="noopener noreferrer".
import ChannelButton from '../components/ChannelButton.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Index from '../components/Index.astro';
import NeutralLayout from '../layouts/NeutralLayout.astro';
import { t } from '../i18n/index.ts';
import { getDiscordPage } from '../lib/discord-page.ts';
import { HTML_LANG, LOCALES } from '../lib/routes.ts';

const containers = await getDiscordPage();
---

<NeutralLayout title={t('en-us', 'discord.meta.title')} description={t('en-us', 'discord.meta.description')} noindex>
  <Index>
    {
      LOCALES.map((locale) => {
        const page = containers[locale];
        const isFirst = locale === 'pt-br';
        const Heading = isFirst ? 'h1' : 'h2';
        const RuleHeading = isFirst ? 'h2' : 'h3';
        return (
          <section
            id={locale}
            lang={HTML_LANG[locale]}
            class:list={['gate grid scroll-mt-24 gap-x-24 gap-y-24 lg:grid-cols-12', isFirst ? 'pb-64 lg:pb-96' : 'border-t border-pauta pt-64 lg:pt-96']}
          >
            <div class="lg:col-span-4">
              <Heading class="font-display text-headline text-papel">{t(locale, 'discord.heading')}</Heading>
              <p class="mt-8 text-body-sm text-papel-suave">{t(locale, 'discord.updated', { date: page.date })}</p>
              {
                isFirst && (
                  <p class="mt-16">
                    <a href="#en-us" lang="en-US" class="link-text inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-8 text-body-sm">
                      <span>{t('en-us', 'discord.jump')}</span>
                      <Icon name="arrow-down" />
                    </a>
                  </p>
                )
              }
            </div>
            <div class="lg:col-span-8 lg:pl-32">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-32">
                {
                  page.rules.map((rule) => (
                    <div>
                      <RuleHeading class="font-display text-title text-papel">{rule.title}</RuleHeading>
                      <p class="mt-8 max-w-[72ch] whitespace-pre-line text-body text-papel-suave">{rule.body}</p>
                    </div>
                  ))
                }
                {page.closing !== undefined && <p class="max-w-[72ch] text-body font-medium text-papel">{page.closing}</p>}
              </div>

              <div class="mt-48 border-t border-pauta pt-32">
                <div class="flex min-h-[44px] items-start gap-12">
                  <input type="checkbox" id={`agree-${locale}`} class="agree mt-[10px] size-24 shrink-0 accent-papel" autocomplete="off" />
                  <label for={`agree-${locale}`} class="max-w-[72ch] py-8 text-body text-papel">{t(locale, 'discord.agree')}</label>
                </div>
                <p class="gate-pending mt-16 text-body-sm text-papel-suave">{t(locale, 'discord.pending')}</p>
                <div class="gate-links mt-16">
                  <p class="text-body-sm text-papel-suave">{t(locale, 'discord.links.lead')}</p>
                  <div
                    class:list={[
                      'mt-12 grid',
                      page.links.length > 1 ? 'grid-cols-[repeat(2,minmax(0,280px))] gap-16 sm:gap-24' : 'sm:grid-cols-[280px]',
                    ]}
                  >
                    {page.links.map((link) => (
                      <ChannelButton href={link.href} label={link.label} icon={link.id} external narrow={page.links.length > 1} />
                    ))}
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        );
      })
    }
  </Index>
</NeutralLayout>
